WEBVTT

13:06.896 --> 13:09.231
Septa Mordane says
I have to do it again.

13:09.357 --> 13:12.068
My things weren't
properly folded, she says.

13:12.193 --> 13:15.154
Who cares how they're folded?
They're going to get all messed up anyway.

13:15.279 --> 13:17.448
It's good you've got help.

13:17.573 --> 13:19.158
Watch.

13:19.283 --> 13:21.202
Nymeria, gloves.

13:25.122 --> 13:26.582
(WHIMPERS)

13:27.416 --> 13:29.585
- Impressive.
- Shut up.

13:29.710 --> 13:31.670
Nymeria, gloves!
